/// Its constructor runs UpdateModule's constructor, clears its own state
/// and asks to be updated on the next logic frame with
/// UpdateModule::setWakeFrame. Its data (StrafeAreaUpdateModuleData) names
/// a weapon and gives an area radius and the frequency, amplitude, slope
/// and starting phase of a sweep; the module's per-frame behaviour is not
/// described here. Neither Zero Hour nor BFME 1 has the class.
