///        fields plus a value multiplier and a science-based bonus.
///
/// Built once per module line by
/// SupplyCenterDockUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData. The module
/// itself is created by SupplyCenterDockUpdate::friend_newModuleInstance,
/// which is not documented here. Its field parse function,
/// SupplyCenterDockUpdateModuleData::buildFieldParse, first registers
/// DockUpdateModuleData::buildFieldParse's table (see the group page) and
/// then its own. Zero Hour: SupplyCenterDockUpdate is the dock where
/// supply gatherers deliver what they carry.
///
/// \par Modding
/// Its own fields, read from the retail table, with the constructor
/// defaults:
/// - \c ValueMultiplier, a real number, 1 by default;
/// - \c BonusScience, a science looked up by name; the default is minus
///   one (Zero Hour uses minus one for "no science");
/// - \c BonusScienceMultiplier, a percentage, 100 percent by default.
///
/// The names suggest that delivered value is scaled, and scaled further
/// when the owner has the bonus science; this page does not confirm how
/// they are applied. Zero Hour's SupplyCenterDockUpdateModuleData has a
/// single field of its own, \c GrantTemporaryStealth, which BFME 2's table
/// does not have.
///
/// \see SupplyCenterDockUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData,
